  "id": "creamy-mashed-potatoes",
  "name": "Creamy Mashed Potatoes",
  "subtitle": "Smooth, buttery potatoes for the table",
  "description": "Floury potatoes are boiled until tender, mashed until smooth, and enriched with melted butter and whole milk.",
